WEBVTT

00:02:00.038 --> 00:02:03.246
So how come you can imagine it anyway?

00:02:04.329 --> 00:02:07.371
One hypothesis, called 
the “Mental Synthesis Theory”,

00:02:07.413 --> 00:02:11.413
says that, again, timing is key.

00:02:11.538 --> 00:02:14.121
If the neuronal ensembles
for the dolphin and pineapple

00:02:14.163 --> 00:02:15.746
are activated at the same time,

00:02:15.788 --> 00:02:20.621
we can perceive the two separate
objects as a single image.

00:02:20.663 --> 00:02:24.246
But something in your brain
has to coordinate that firing.

00:02:24.288 --> 00:02:27.163
One plausible candidate
is the prefrontal cortex,

00:02:27.204 --> 00:02:30.454
which is involved
in all complex cognitive functions.